INSERT INTO `rubric_criteria_options` VALUES (1,'The teacher demonstrates they can make a connection with students. They show that they genuinely enjoy students, knowing kids learn better when they believe the teacher likes them.',1,1,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:55:53'),(2,'The teacher demonstrates they can make a connection with students. They show that they genuinely enjoy students, knowing kids learn better when they believe the teacher likes them.',2,1,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:55:53'),(3,'The teacher demonstrates they can make a connection with students. They show that they genuinely enjoy students, knowing kids learn better when they believe the teacher likes them.',3,1,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:55:53'),(4,'The teacher possesses the tools and process by which they assess the students‚Äô understanding of the subject. They utilize a system for measuring student growth.',1,2,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:14'),(5,'The teacher possesses the tools and process by which they assess the students‚Äô understanding of the subject. They utilize a system for measuring student growth.',2,2,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:14'),(6,'The teacher possesses the tools and process by which they assess the students‚Äô understanding of the subject. They utilize a system for measuring student growth.',3,2,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:14'),(7,'The teacher creates an atmosphere that‚Äôs conducive for learning. They find ways to keep every student ‚Äúin the game.‚Äù No assignment enables a student to give up. The teacher pursues the marginalized student.',1,3,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:30'),(8,'The teacher creates an atmosphere that‚Äôs conducive for learning. They find ways to keep every student ‚Äúin the game.‚Äù No assignment enables a student to give up. The teacher pursues the marginalized student.',2,3,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:30'),(9,'The teacher creates an atmosphere that‚Äôs conducive for learning. They find ways to keep every student ‚Äúin the game.‚Äù No assignment enables a student to give up. The teacher pursues the marginalized student.',3,3,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:30'),(10,'The teacher knows their subject well. They‚Äôve mastered the content and know how to communicate it to appropriate grade levels.',1,4,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:54'),(11,'The teacher knows their subject well. They‚Äôve mastered the content and know how to communicate it to appropriate grade levels.',2,4,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:54'),(12,'The teacher knows their subject well. They‚Äôve mastered the content and know how to communicate it to appropriate grade levels.',3,4,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:56:54'),(13,'The teacher never stops learning and growing themselves. They find creative ways to upgrade their lesson plans and pedagogy. They are a ‚Äústream,‚Äù not a ‚Äúpond.‚Äù',1,5,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:57:14'),(14,'The teacher never stops learning and growing themselves. They find creative ways to upgrade their lesson plans and pedagogy. They are a ‚Äústream,‚Äù not a ‚Äúpond.‚Äù',2,5,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:57:14'),(15,'The teacher never stops learning and growing themselves. They find creative ways to upgrade their lesson plans and pedagogy. They are a ‚Äústream,‚Äù not a ‚Äúpond.‚Äù',3,5,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:57:14'),(16,'It‚Äôs important the teacher has a clear voice in the classroom, but also that students do as well. The course experience should not be a talking head, a one-way transmission of data ‚Äî the students‚Äô needs and make up should inform the pedagogy.',1,6,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:58:05'),(17,'It‚Äôs important the teacher has a clear voice in the classroom, but also that students do as well. The course experience should not be a talking head, a one-way transmission of data ‚Äî the students‚Äô needs and make up should inform the pedagogy.',2,6,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:58:05'),(18,'It‚Äôs important the teacher has a clear voice in the classroom, but also that students do as well. The course experience should not be a talking head, a one-way transmission of data ‚Äî the students‚Äô needs and make up should inform the pedagogy.',3,6,NULL,NULL,8,'2016-06-23 02:58:05');
